Hyphenation patterns from the hyph-utf8 project (https://github.com/hyphenation/tex-hyphen,
commit 5684c0f51c0b81133db2efbe60a408b4155a3ff5), converted to JS by scripts/fetch-hyphen-patterns.sh.
The original copyright and licence notices of each file follow.

